{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は町にある物や\nスーパーにあるおかしのパッケージが冬仕様になっていて\nうきうきしてました(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今日はものすごく寒さを感じました(╥ω╥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22日は横浜で個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部から沢山の方が会いに来てくださり、手があったまりました(｡・・｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部は白いタートルニットに\nサスペンダー付きのズボンに\n黒いニット帽！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は後ろでちょこんと\n一つにくくったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部はピンクのグラデーションニットにルームソックスに\nハスキー犬のニット帽！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このハスキー犬に向かって話す人\nたくさんいたー(｀ε´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子の握手会なのに(｀ε´)まったく(｀ε´)ハスキー犬めっ！(｀ε´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいから許すっ(｀ε´)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部は白いノルディック柄のニットに\n白いオーバーオール！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、しかし！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真を撮るのを忘れてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい(；д；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"許してわんっ(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。ごめんなさい(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"29日の個別握手会もよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を着ようかな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木中みてくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう！ほんとに！\nまったくもーだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピスタチオのマカロンが食べたかったのに！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を食べても舌がピリピリするし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんがついでくれた\nお水は酸っぱいし\nまいちゅんがついでくれた\nお茶は苦いし！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いよ！\n酸っぱいよ！\n苦いよ！\nって言っても\n3人は平然としてるから\n日奈子がおかしいんだと思ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは、もっと\n疑い深くならないとっ(｀ε´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふんっ(｀ε´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あのね！\n収録終わったあと、\nピスタチオ食べたかった～って\n言ってたらスタッフさんが\nマカロン全種類入ってるのを\n一箱下さって\nうきうきしながら持って帰って\nピスタチオ１つたべたらね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのピスタチオも激辛だったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラ回ってないのに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでも、だまされたの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のもぜーーーーんぶ\n激辛だった(   ˙࿁˙   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラまわってないところで\n大騒ぎしました(   ˙࿁˙   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね、帰り道に\n舌を震わせながら\nお母さんにドッキリにひっかかったの。と、電話しました(｡ρω-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木中をみて\nより一層二期生だいすきになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送後すぐに、\n卒業生の矢田里沙子たんから\n「マカロンのドッキリよかったよ！運が悪かっただけだよ！」と、\n少しバカにしたメールが来ました(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったく(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"里沙子だいすきだ(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/23/8950590/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またかきます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}